# Docker build context exclusion for builds that use the repository root as
# context (e.g. the ros-monitor image). Keeps the context small and avoids
# shipping build artifacts, secrets, or the Android tree into the image.
.git
**/build
**/outputs
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.venv
**/*.egg-info/
*.apk
*.ndjson
local.properties
google-services.json
INTERNAL.md
LyrebirdApp
GroundStation/video_test/logs
GroundStation/video_test/webapp
GroundStation/tests
GroundStation/Python/test_scripts
GroundStation/ROS/lyrebird_videofeed
GroundStation/ROS/lyrebird_bringup
# ...except the launch file the ros-monitor image reuses for auto-discovery.
!GroundStation/ROS/lyrebird_bringup/launch/auto_discovery_native.launch.py
GroundStation/ROS/requirements.txt
GroundStation/video_test/compose.yaml
scripts/verify-integration.sh
README.md
LICENSE
